  - >-
    Night 1 of David Gilmour’s three-night Hollywood Bowl residency marked a
    rare event: his first live shows in eight years, limited to just four cities
    worldwide (Rome, London, Los Angeles, and New York). Supporting his fifth
    solo album Luck and Strange, the 78-year-old Pink Floyd guitarist paired
    lush new material with transcendent Pink Floyd landmarks under the Hollywood
    Hills.
